<% layout('layout') -%>
<section class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">GLOBAL · LANGUAGE TEST · NO LOGIN</div><h1>Parcel language test</h1><p>Test from two phones. Phone A can create a parcel in English; Phone B selects Punjabi and sees the same parcel information localized. This demo uses sample phrases only, not full automatic translation.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Create a test parcel</h2><form id="demo-create" class="form-grid"><label>Origin / sender area<input name="from" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Punjab, India" value="Punjab, India"></label><label>Destination / receiver area<input name="to" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Kerala, India" value="Kerala, India"></label><label>Language used by sender<select name="sourceLanguage"><option value="en">English</option><option value="pa">Punjabi</option><option value="hi">Hindi</option></select></label><label>Show response in<select name="viewLanguage"><option value="en" <%= lang==='en'?'selected':'' %>>English</option><option value="pa" <%= lang==='pa'?'selected':'' %>>Punjabi</option><option value="hi" <%= lang==='hi'?'selected':'' %>>Hindi</option></select></label><button class="button primary full" type="submit">Create shared demo parcel</button></form><p id="demo-create-result" role="status"></p></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="actions" style="justify-content:space-between"><h2>Shared demo parcels</h2><button id="demo-refresh" class="button secondary" type="button">Refresh parcels</button></div><p>Choose the language in the top menu, then refresh. Both phones must open the same deployed website URL.</p><div id="demo-parcels" aria-live="polite">Loading…</div></section>
